<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
    <head>
        <meta charset="UTF-8">
        <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
        <title>폴리오</title>
        <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
        <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
        <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/sidebar.css">
        <link
            href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@1,400;1,600&family=Noto+Serif+KR:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap"
            rel="stylesheet">
        <style>
            :root {
                box-sizing: border-box;
                padding-top: env(safe-area-inset-top, 0px);
                padding-bottom: env(safe-area-inset-bottom, 0px);

                --bg: #faf9f6;
                --ink: #1a1a1a;
                --ink-soft: #8f8a82;
                --line: #ddd7cc;
                --orange: #e9692c;
            }

            html {
                scroll-padding-top: env(safe-area-inset-top, 0px);
            }

            * {
                box-sizing: border-box;
            }

            @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
                :root:not([data-theme="light"]) {
                    --bg: #171613;
                    --ink: #ECE7E0;
                    --ink-soft: #948e84;
                    --line: #38352c;
                }
            }

            :root[data-theme="dark"] {
                --bg: #171613;
                --ink: #ECE7E0;
                --ink-soft: #948e84;
                --line: #38352c;
            }

            html,
            body {
                height: 100%;
                margin: 0;
                background: var(--bg);
                color: var(--ink);
                font-family: 'Noto Serif KR', serif;
                -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
            }

            .page {
                min-height: 100%;
                display: flex;
                flex-direction: column;
                max-width: 1440px;
                margin: 0 auto;
                padding: 48px 64px 40px;
            }

            header.top {
                display: flex;
                justify-content: space-between;
                align-items: flex-start;
            }

            .wordmark {
                font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
                font-style: italic;
                font-weight: 400;
                font-size: clamp(44px, 7vw, 88px);
                line-height: 1;
                margin: 0;
            }

            .signup-link {
                background: none;
                border: none;
                font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
                font-style: italic;
                font-size: 18px;
                color: var(--ink);
                cursor: pointer;
                padding: 4px 0;
            }

            main.hero {
                flex: 1;
                display: flex;
                flex-direction: column;
                align-items: center;
                justify-content: center;
                text-align: center;
                gap: 28px;
                padding: 40px 0;
            }

            .slogan {
                font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
                font-style: italic;
                font-weight: 400;
                font-size: clamp(30px, 6vw, 70px);
                line-height: 1.35;
                margin: 0;
            }

            .slogan .l2 {
                display: block;
                margin-left: clamp(0px, 6vw, 90px);
                margin-top: 6px;
            }

            .tagline {
                font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
                font-style: italic;
                font-size: clamp(16px, 2vw, 26px);
                color: var(--ink);
                margin: 0;
            }

            .login-pill {
                margin-top: 10px;
                background: transparent;
                border: 1.5px solid var(--line);
                border-radius: 30px;
                padding: 15px 64px;
                font-family: 'Noto Serif KR', serif;
                font-size: 14px;
                letter-spacing: 0.06em;
                color: var(--ink);
                cursor: pointer;
                transition: border-color 0.2s, color 0.2s;
            }

            .login-pill:hover {
                border-color: var(--orange);
                color: var(--orange);
            }

            footer.scroll-note {
                text-align: center;
                font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
                font-style: italic;
                font-size: clamp(13px, 1.6vw, 20px);
                color: var(--ink-soft);
                padding-top: 10px;
            }

            @media (max-width: 640px) {
                .page {
                    padding: 28px 24px 30px;
                }

                .slogan .l2 {
                    margin-left: 20px;
                }
            }

        </style>
    </head>
    <body>
        <div class="page">
            <header class="top">
                <h1 class="wordmark">폴리오</h1>
                <button class="signup-link" id="signupLink">회원가입</button>
            </header>

            <main class="hero">
                <h2 class="slogan">이곳은 슬로건 자리<span class="l2">뭔가가 적혀져있지.</span>
                </h2>
                <p class="tagline">캘린더. 일기. 주기. 친구 ~</p>
                <button class="login-pill" id="loginBtn">로그인</button>
            </main>

            <footer class="scroll-note">하단 스크롤 시에 노션 웹 처럼 내부 페이지 별 기능 설명 보여주기</footer>
        </div>

        <script>
            document.getElementById('loginBtn').addEventListener('click', function() {
                window.location.href = "/login";
            });
            document.getElementById('signupLink').addEventListener('click', function() {
                // 회원가입 기능은 아직 준비 중입니다
            });

        </script>
    </body>
</html>
